                                "text": "(Lakatos, 4) Not only was Brahms influenced by Liszt but also by Jozsef Joachim, the great violinist. The Variations on a Hungarian Song, Op. 21 and his Zigeunerlieder are well-known, but \"magyarisms\" can be found in many of ..."
